      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m about to embark on my first mammoth solo game (trying to run 4 spirits). I&#39;ve done most/all the setup for the other games I&#39;ve played, but have only just noticed the following things:</p><ul><li>All the setup cities are in coastal lands</li><li>There is one city in each land type</li><li>There is one town in each land type</li><li>All the towns are in inland lands.</li></ul><p>The Dahan distribution isn&#39;t quite as symmetrical, but it&#39;s still pretty cool to have noticed. Kudos!</p>",
