      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-28T23:14:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd noticed the part about city in land #2 and the town placed so that everything will always be hit on the initial explore, as well - those were a little more obvious.</p><p>The part about each terrain type having both a city and a town when all 4 tiles are in play is a little more subtle, along with the other observation I accidentally omitted from my original post about each type of terrain being blighted exactly once.</p>",
